-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- a property over oc-Obs
-- "the reply to each get is the number of incs before it", as a predicate on traces: read the
-- trace keeping the number of incs so far and the replies owed (one per get, oldest first);
-- a reply must be the oldest one owed (a reply nobody is owed is not allowed)
oc-snoc : List Nat → Nat → List Nat
oc-snoc l v = case l of nil → cons v nil; cons e r → cons e (rec r)
